  "bio": "Juan Diaz Tattoo is a highly skilled artist specializing in the delicate and intricate fineline tattoo style. Operating out of 12th Dynasty Tattoo Studio in Swindon, United Kingdom, Juan's work beautifully captures the essence of magic and allure with a keen obsession for dotwork and linework. To witness the mesmerizing union of art and skin, reach out to Juan for bookings with confidence in his professionalism and mastery within the realm of fineline tattoos.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Swindon, England, United Kingdom\n\nTattoo Artist with an obsession for dotwork/linework and all things magical & beautiful. @ 12th Dynasty Tattoo Studio Swindon. Email/msg for bookings.",
